  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Winterization Response Plan Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to UNICEF&apos;s Revised Ukraine Winter Response Plan. UNICEF&#x2019;s winterization approach will target cash and in-kind support to the most vulnerable categories of girls, boys, and women &#x2013; especially children with disabilities, children without parental care and women at risk or survivors of violence.</narrative>
  </description>
